tent/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) The authority vested in the Presi­\ndent by section 801(a) of the Foreign \nService Act of 1946 (22 U.S.C. 1061(a)) \nto prescribe rules and regulations for the \nmaintenance of the Foreign Service Re­\ntirement and Disability System.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(a)","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec1(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The authority vested in the Presi­\ndent by section 803(c) (1) of the Foreign \nService Act of 1946, as amended (22 \nU.S.C. 1063(c)(1)), to prescribe regula­\ntions governing the participation of cer­\ntain Foreign Service staff officers and \nemployees in the Foreign Service Retire­\nment and Disability System.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(b)","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec1(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) The authority vested in the Presi­\ndent by section 881(a) of the Foreign \nService Act of 1946, as amended (22 \nU.S.C. 1116(a) ), to prescribe regulations \ngoverning the deposit of voluntary con­\ntributions into the Foreign Service Re­\ntirement and Disability Fund.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 1(c)","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec1(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 2. Executive Order No. 9941 of \nMarch 26,1948, is hereby superseded.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 2","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec2","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. This order shall be effective as \nof October 16,1960; and the Secretary of \nState, in his discretion and consistent \nwith law, may make rules and regula­\ntions issued pursuant to section 1  hereof \neffective on or after that date.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3; Sec. 3","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:10897#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null}],"original_representation":{"page_or_item":"25 FR 12429, PDF pages 3-3","sha256":"365c4831298d98c96235b0d637c2e1a842ec456a011cd199c71b78e3a5996b5f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1960-12-06/pdf/FR-1960-12-06.pdf"},"research_rationale":"","savings_residuals":null,"schema":"eo-lifecycle-claim/v1","unresolved_material_gaps":["DRAFT: state_at_cutoff not decided for 6 clause(s); clause inventory completeness not confirmed","DRAFT: whole-order ending not established","DRAFT: savings and residual effects not closed","DRAFT: later_source_search not recorded (machine searches are proposals only; paste them after judging them adequate and resolving every CONFLICT line)"],"whole_order_end":null,"whole_order_status":"no"},"draft_schema":"eo-claim-draft/v1","instrument_id":"EO:10897"}
